### Assistant service — manual examples (IntelliJ HTTP Client)
# Run the infrastructure (docker compose up -d postgres kafka redis), triage-service and assistant-service.
# Register / change patients with http/triage.http: the assistant rebuilds its view only from triaje.eventos.
#
# API key: select the "local" environment and put the real key (ASSISTANT_API_KEY of your .env) in
# http/http-client.private.env.json, which is git-ignored:
#   { "local": { "triageApiKey": "<TRIAGE_API_KEY>", "assistantApiKey": "<ASSISTANT_API_KEY>" } }

@assistantUrl = http://localhost:8081

### Security — no X-API-Key (expected: 401 ProblemDetail "No autenticado", "Falta el header X-API-Key.")
GET {{assistantUrl}}/asistente/estado-urgencias

### Health — readiness probe, public (expected: 200 {"status":"UP"} while Redis answers; never depends on the LLM)
GET {{assistantUrl}}/actuator/health/readiness

### Metrics — Prometheus, protected (expected: 200 with assistant_llm_latency_seconds{operation,outcome})
GET {{assistantUrl}}/actuator/prometheus
X-API-Key: {{assistantApiKey}}


### RF-04 B — Live emergency-room status (expected: 200; the 5 levels are always present, EN_CONSULTA counts as active)
# {
#   "totalActivos": 3,
#   "porNivel": { "CRITICO": 1, "URGENTE": 1, "URGENTE_2": 0, "NO_URGENTE": 1, "NO_URGENTE_2": 0 }
# }
# After PATCH .../estado {"estado": "ALTA"} on a patient, its level count drops by one within a moment.
GET {{assistantUrl}}/asistente/estado-urgencias
X-API-Key: {{assistantApiKey}}

### RF-04 A — Example 1: hypertensive crisis (expected: 200, fuentes contains {"protocolo": "PROTO-001", "seccion": "Medidas iniciales"})
# 503 "El asistente clínico no está disponible..." if OPENAI_API_KEY is missing or the corpus is still being indexed.
POST {{assistantUrl}}/asistente/consulta
X-API-Key: {{assistantApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pregunta": "¿Cuáles son las medidas iniciales ante una crisis hipertensiva?"
}

### RF-04 A — Example 2: sepsis (expected: 200, fuentes contains {"protocolo": "PROTO-002", "seccion": "Acciones iniciales"})
POST {{assistantUrl}}/asistente/consulta
X-API-Key: {{assistantApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pregunta": "¿Cuándo se administra el primer antibiótico en sepsis?"
}

### RF-04 A — Example 3: not in the corpus (expected: 200, "No existe un protocolo disponible en el corpus para esta pregunta.", fuentes [])
POST {{assistantUrl}}/asistente/consulta
X-API-Key: {{assistantApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pregunta": "¿Cuál es el tratamiento de primera línea para la diabetes tipo 2?"
}

### RF-04 A — Blank question (expected: 400, errors[0].campo = pregunta)
POST {{assistantUrl}}/asistente/consulta
X-API-Key: {{assistantApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pregunta": "   "
}
